ype\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Troubleshooting GitHub skills**\\n\\nI’m thinking about using the GitHub skill, but it seems like there was a failure due to tilde expansion. Maybe checking the exact path with /root would help, though it might not be necessary. Using `gh` directly might also work. I’m considering scanning in four directions, and I need to append this information to my current priority table. I might want to locate a specific section and then utilize exec and web_fetch effectively.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"先扫四个方向，再把结果写进项目文件并发给 main。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0397c61f16fbcc730169cd5dffbb088191a57ee2776a454fd2\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mkW2UEXS2vVbD663FLEokKfU|fc_0397c61f16fbcc730169cd5dffe7948191bf0090d24930da8c","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md","extractMode":"text","maxChars":12000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md\",\"extractMode\":\"text\",\"maxChars\":12000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rKN7yENCTyNgXagJfMXoqFjx|fc_0397c61f16fbcc730169cd5dffe7a08191873fbb72e6b230fd","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions","extractMode":"text","maxChars":8000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions\",\"extractMode\":\"text\",\"maxChars\":8000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6KEwDjnsX8iHIlkcFdMyVXMq|fc_0397c61f16fbcc730169cd5dffe7a88191b159a1b866b3dce2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python - <<'PY'\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone\nnow=datetime.now(timezone.utc)\nprint((now-timedelta(hours=2)).isoformat().replace('+00:00','Z'))\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python - <<'PY'\\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta, timezone\\nnow=datetime.now(timezone.utc)\\nprint((now-timedelta(hours=2)).isoformat().replace('+00:00','Z'))\\nPY\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.o