subagent:10c3dffa-e424-4dcc-bdaf-82e30acc5170","agent:main:subagent:3015f350-c7e1-49c4-84ea-195562ff6daf","agent:main:subagent:c235aae8-de27-475e-b934-79c6a71b808d","agent:main:subagent:95c039a2-2122-49c7-b418-1692a04560cb","agent:main:subagent:aa43f92c-5617-447c-8fcf-d689d817946b","agent:main:subagent:225ac70c-e2a4-4dc4-bad7-9339d4ea776b","agent:main:subagent:0229cd7f-2194-4a39-b483-5a17dfc7fdba","agent:main:subagent:8367e860-ffea-46d4-bfea-740e6547b135","agent:main:subagent:78ef719e-f7f7-42bf-8539-f95a6b85f6f5","agent:main:subagent:8334c7cb-7d33-4b95-aa6a-17eaf83dd956","agent:main:subagent:f60e9c04-fc6d-4592-add0-bd18bab9e64a","agent:main:subagent:8b870b86-83b9-488e-9977-58fbb445bc65","agent:main:subagent:c3e36502-ee4e-4d91-9234-5f39e8e5e0ef","agent:main:subagent:ee05d3ae-111d-4e2e-8ecd-af6ffbe855f0"],"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"feishu","lastTo":"user:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8","lastAccountId":"default","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/16b859d4-1a91-40c7-838a-dcb91a6d4974.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":"收到，这轮优先级我直接收敛成 3 条：\n\n## 当前最该打\n### 1. #59027\n**2026.3.31 升级后 telegram / amazon-bedrock bundled plugins 缺 runtime module，直接加载失败**\n\n这是现在最先查的。  \n本质是 **打包 / 依赖 staging 回归**，影响的是插件直接起不来。\n\n链接：  \nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59027\n\n### 2. #57950\n**browser.request 在 browser plugin 已加载时仍缺失，browser 整体不可用**\n\n这条也很重，而且和我们前面已经处理过的 browser 链路问题是同一大类，值得马上并案看。\n\n链接：  \nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57950\n\n### 3. #58356\n**system.run.prepare / paired macOS node exec 在 2026.3.28 后失效**\n\n这是 paired-node / macOS exec 能力回归，影响核心能力，但我排在前两条后面。\n\n链接：  \nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/58356\n\n## 我的判断\n这轮别分散，顺序就按这个来：\n\n**先 #59027 → 再 #57950 → 再 #58356**\n\n原因很直接：\n- **#59027** 是插件直接加载失败，属于“起不来”\n- **#57950** 是 browser 整体不可用，属于“能起但废了”\n- **#58356** 是特定 exec 能力回归，范围略窄一点\n\n## 一句话\n这轮核心不是再扩新面，而是先压住 **runtime 打包回归** 和 **browser 注册链路回归**。  \n这两个都是平台基础设施级问题。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_004b85437a29b0680169cd509ad4308191ac79a03c82a0b579\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":95198,"output":414,"totalTokens":95612,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0.244205}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775063191852,"responseId":"resp_004b85437a29b0680169cd50983bec8191b7d5d78c09251260","__openclaw":{"id":"6d1b75df","seq":709}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:memory-daily-create","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","displayName":"Cron: 每日自动创建日记并整理昨日任务","updatedAt":1775061172807,"sessionId":"abea84b2-0e83-4137-99d0-4833eea9d6b5","model":"gpt-5.4","contextTokens":272000,"totalTokens":80986,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"failed","startedAt":1775061156646,"endedAt":1775061164399,"runtimeMs":7753,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/abea84b2-0e83-4137-99d0-4833eea9d6b5.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":""},{"type":"text","text":"刚才那个异步命令**没有执行**。\n\n原因很简单：它走的是 `exec`，需要审批，但审批在超时前没有通过，所以被系统拒绝了：\n\n- 状态：`Exec denied`\n- 原因：`approval-timeout`\n- gateway id：`271967b9-4f93-4d3c-a828-339a3c99b5ae`\n\n所以**没有新的命令输出**，我也**不会重新运行**这条命令。\n\n如果你要我继续处理这类任务，我可以改用**不需要这条 exec 的方式**来做，或者你给我一个新的明确指令。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0be5fa6b8b87d25c0169cd48b299348191a23a4f168509ca74\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":80986,"output":164,"totalTokens":81150,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"total":0.204925}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775061165439,"responseId":"resp_0be5fa6b8b87d25c0169cd48aef890819184ebb4c0b9e43b75","__openclaw":{"id":"d9762962","seq":23}}]},{"key":"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3","kind":"group","channel":"feishu","orig