{"type":"message","id":"3cd13690","parentId":"66327549","timestamp":"2026-04-01T18:04:37.409Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_UeRWUwix89Qh2pCfXkR7YP4v|fc_0397c61f16fbcc730169cd5e331fc081918fe8e994b9a19c4c","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues \\\"Apr 2, 2026\\\" \\\"openclaw/openclaw/issues/590\\\"\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 1895,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71c7e9d0ad71e726\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug] Command execution failures due to PATH issues in LaunchAgent · Issue #9302 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71c7e9d0ad71e726\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/9302\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dfd3f03cfa5ecb43\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTitle: [Bug] Command execution failures due to PATH issues in LaunchAgent · Issue #9302 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n# Search code, repositories, users, issues, pull requests... You signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. You switched accounts on another tab or window. There was an error while loading. * Notifications  You must be signed in to change notification settings. # [Bug] Command execution failures due to PATH issues in LaunchAgent #9302. [[Bug] Command execution failures due to PATH issues in LaunchAgent](#top)#9302. bugSomething isn't workingSomething isn't working. OpenClaw runs as LaunchAgent but commands fail because PATH is not properly set, causing `command not found` errors. ## Errors Found. `openclaw` command not found (4 occurrences). 2026-02-02T21:44:53.416Z [tools] exec failed: openclaw not found 2026-02-03T12:29:52.982Z [tools] exec failed: zsh:1: command not found: openclaw. `python` command not found (2 occurrences). 2026-02-04T13:03:35.625Z [tools] exec failed: zsh:1: command not found: python 2026-02-04T17:30:01.208Z [tools] exec failed: zsh:1: command not found: python. 2026-02-04T14:53:16.108Z [tools] exec failed: zsh:1: command not found: screencapture. ## Root Cause. When OpenClaw runs as **LaunchAgent**, it doesn't inherit user's shell environment:. * No `~/.zshrc` or `~/.bashrc` loaded. + `~/.nvm/versions/node/*/bin` (Node/npm). + User's custom PATH additions. Tools that rely on system commands fail:. * Self-referential commands (`openclaw` calling itself). * Skills installed via npm/homebrew. LaunchAgent should have proper PATH including:. * System binaries (`/usr/bin`, `/usr/local/bin`). * Node.js (`~/.nvm` or global node). * User additions from shell profile. ### Option 1: Set PATH in LaunchAgent plist. ### Option 2: Source user shell profile. ### Option 3: Detect and set PATH automatically. function getSystemPATH() string{const paths =['/opt/homebrew/bin',// Homebrew (Apple Silicon)'/usr/local/bin',// Homebrew (Intel) process. NVM_DIR`${process.env.NVM_DIR}/current/bin`${process.env.NVM_DIR}${process. NVM_DIR} null,'/usr/bin','/bin','/usr/sbin','/sbin',]. ### Option 4: Use absolute paths for known commands. Map common commands to their likely locations:. const COMMAND_PATHS ={'python''/opt/homebrew/bin/python3', 'python3''/usr/bin/python3', 'screencapture''/usr/sbin/screencapture', 'openclaw''/opt/homebrew/bin/openclaw',};. 1. Install OpenClaw as LaunchAgent (`openclaw gateway start`). 2. Try to execute command that uses `openclaw`, `python`, or `screencapture`. 3. Observe `command not found` error. Manually add to LaunchAgent plist:. \\\"/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin\\\" \\\" \\\". ## Environment. * OpenClaw: 2026.2.2-3. ## Related Issues. * Commands work fine when run manually in terminal (has full PATH). * Issue only affects LaunchAgent/daemon mode. bugSomething isn't workingSomething isn't working. No branches or pull requests. ## Issue actions. You can’t perform that action at this time.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dfd3f03cfa5ecb43\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99986446\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b6d3163be7f90064\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBug: openclaw logs WebSocket handshake timeout in WSL2 · Issue #47952 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b6d3163be7f90064\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/47952\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ec54a393496e5d93\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTitle: Bug: openclaw logs WebSocket handshake timeout in WSL2 · Issue #47952 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n## Navigation Menu. # Search code, repositories, users, issues, pull requests... You signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. There was an error while loading. * Notifications  You must be signed in to change notification settings. # Bug: openclaw logs WebSocket handshake timeout in WSL2 #47952. Bug: openclaw logs WebSocket handshake timeout in WSL2#47952. ## Description. opened on Mar 16, 2026. **Version:** OpenClaw 2026.3.13 (61d171a). **Environment:** WSL2 (Ubuntu), Node 22.22.1 via nvm. 1. Run `openclaw logs --follow`. 2. Observe \\\"gateway connect failed: Error: gateway closed (1000)\\\". * HTTP health check works: `curl http://127.0.0.1:18789/health` returns `{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"status\\\":\\\"live\\\"}`. * WebSocket connection fails with handshake timeout (~3-5 seconds). * Gateway runtime status shows \\\"RPC probe: ok\\\". * Gateway log shows: `handshake timeout conn=xxx remote=127.0.0.1`. `openclaw logs` should connect via WebSocket and stream l